            "review_title": "Review at Hao Hao Seafood Danang",
            "review_text": "mwbell2000\nPattaya, Thailand87 contributions\n0\nA Lesson in Waitressing\nApr 2019 • Friends\nAll I wanted was a sandwich at lunch time. It was a sea food place and my girlfriend wanted prawns. It was one of those places where you have to play God and decide who live; who dies.\nThe menu was confusing so I kept asking about various dishes. I decided on the Singapore noodles which looked sufficient to sate both our appetites, there being no sandwiches. It duly arrived and was everything I'd hoped for. Then a Prawns in Coconut dish arrived which I'd vaguely asked about.. I gritted my teeth whilst my girlfriend grew fatter by the minute. When a THIRD dish arrived I asked how many more the waitress thought I'd ordered. Luckily I was assured this was the end. We left stuffed and considerably poorer.\nMight I ask management here to teach waitresses to read back an order to check if it is correct?\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 18, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
