            "review_text": "TheFineFoodie\nEurope112 contributions\n1\n90 min wait!\nFeb 2019 • Family\nOur guard recommended this place to us, seeing as it was a short walk from the hotel we decided to give it a try.\n\nWe sat down, after ordering we got our beer fast.. but then.. the waiting started!\nOther tables came, got their food, ate up and left.\nIn total we waited over 90 minutes for our food and did not even get all that we ordered. Other tables also had to wait, so I gather there were a lot of hangry people there that evening.\n\nOn the upside the food was good and cheap.. but the waiting was not worth it, not at all. There are several other places that will serve you the same food a lot faster!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 22, 2019",
