            "review_text": "Ellen_dms\nDendermonde, Belgium26 contributions\n0\nGreat place\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nWe arrived here as we asked our guide to have some seafood where locals eat. Not the expensive massive tourist places you find around Danang. People were friendly, we arrived a bit later in the afternoon after all customers left but this was no problem. Their english is not so good but the menu has some english translations. I can highly recommend the grilled clams (comes with peanut/spring onions sauce) and the seafood salad. Don’t go to the tourist traps... go here! 😃👌🏻\nRead more\nWritten February 13, 2019",
